Stepping
  ok      step over walks the main paragraph without entering performed paragraphs
  ok      step over PERFORM ... TIMES skips all iterations
  ok      step into PERFORM enters the paragraph
  ok      step into a statement other than PERFORM steps over it
  ok      step out of nested paragraphs returns to the main paragraph
  ok      step out of a paragraph reached by breakpoint
  ok      step out of a paragraph performed THRU continues with the range
  ok      breakpoints interrupt step over
  ok      step over STOP RUN ends the session
  ok      step out of the main paragraph ends the session
